<title>CANADA: Canada March advance Raw Materials Index falls.</title>
<headline>Canada March advance Raw Materials Index falls.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index was for a 1.4 percent fall in March from February, Statistics Canada said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			  Mar</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 -5.0</p>
<p>    Metals			  +2.1</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	+0.1</p>
<p>    Wood			    -1.1</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    +0.2</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
</text>
